        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "16. Employees who are required hereinunder to maintain membership, or the payments described in Paragraph 15 above, and fail to do so and employees who are required hereinunder to join the Union and fail to do so shall, upon notice of such action in writing from the Union to the Employer, be replaced by a competent employee whenever such competent employee is available. The Employer shall be the sole judge of the competency of such employees.",
